text = "RTS Watchtower Vision Demo

CONTROLS:
• WASD or Arrow Keys: Move camera
• Mouse Wheel: Zoom in/out
• Middle Mouse + Drag: Rotate camera
• Hover over watchtowers: See vision radius
• Click watchtower: Conquer it
• Press SPACE: Toggle team control
• ESC: Quit

FEATURES:
✓ Eye icon indicates vision towers
✓ Vision radius shown on hover
✓ Tooltip explains benefits
✓ Color-coded by team (Gray=Neutral, Blue=Player, Red=Enemy)"
